OL,3,GNEWSACounty lines heroin and cocaine
OL,4,Adealer jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA county lines drug dealer who ferried
OL,7,Fheroin and crack cocaine between West
OL,8,Fand North Yorkshire has been jailed.
OL,10,FHaqeem Hussain, 28, was sentenced to
OL,11,Fthree years and six months imprisonment
OL,12,Ffor his role in a drug supply network
OL,13,Fknown as the AX line.
OL,15,FDuring a search of his home, police
OL,16,Ffound a significant amount of wraps
OL,17,Fprepared for street-level supply as
OL,18,Fwell as the dealer phone used to
OL,19,Foperate the drugs line.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
